  "id": "section-874",
  "title": "关于西安问题的批示",
  "level": 0,
  "sourceUrl": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-254.htm",
  "html": "<table><tbody><tr><td> -&gt;  -&gt; <a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》</a><hr>\n<b>254)</b>\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n　　送林彪、恩来同志：排斥交大派，支持极“左”派的主张值得研究。应继续作调查研究工作，不必急于表态。破坏工厂，极“左”派是有嫌疑的，而交大派不破坏工厂的。请酌。<br>\n<br>\n　　此件恩来看后送林彪同志。<br><br>\n<p>　　毛泽东<br><br>\n　　二月十四日</p>\n<br><br><hr><p><a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-253.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上一页</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/index.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">目录</a>　<a href=\"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-255.htm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">下一页</a><br><br></p></td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n"
}
